The API client is written from Cisco's public Secure Endpoint API v1
documentation. The add-on contains no Cisco code. Field names are the ones the
Secure Endpoint API returns; the cisco:se event format (the API's JSON plus
EndpointDataType) follows what the Cisco Security Cloud app indexes, so its
search-time settings can be used with this add-on's data.
